(4974331, 724058, 40386, '<td valign="top">This photo really hits home for me because I am in the USA and ny Dad who is dying (cancer spread to his brain) is in South Africa with no way of me being able to get there.  It is really eating me up not being able to say goodbye to him.  To add to it this was the first photo that came up on my screen for voting and commenting on.  Powerful image for me.  Good luck 8</td>', 'This photo really hits home for me because I am in the USA and ny Dad who is dying (cancer spread to his brain) is in South Africa with no way of me being able to get there.  It is really eating me up not being able to say goodbye to him.  To add to it this was the first photo that came up on my screen for voting and commenting on.  Powerful image for me.  Good luck 8', '2008-09-25 09:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4974353, 723378, 40386, '<td valign="top">Comment only no vote - DPCO III Team UK fellow member - I wish I could vote because I still think this was a great idea Lady T, I hope it does well, fingers crossed!!!!</td>', 'Comment only no vote - DPCO III Team UK fellow member - I wish I could vote because I still think this was a great idea Lady T, I hope it does well, fingers crossed!!!!', '2008-09-25 10:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
