(4975450, 724058, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, the colours, the different textures, the perspective; awesome.</td>', 'I love this shot, the colours, the different textures, the perspective; awesome.', '2008-09-25 18:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975451, 723289, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hahaha. Nice and sharp, good capture of the motion.</td>', 'Hahaha. Nice and sharp, good capture of the motion.', '2008-09-25 18:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975452, 724102, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like this idea and the landscape is lovely.</td>', 'I like this idea and the landscape is lovely.', '2008-09-25 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975454, 723074, 94265, '<td valign="top">I imagine this one is doing very well. I like that spotlight surrounding him, really adds to the emotion.</td>', 'I imagine this one is doing very well. I like that spotlight surrounding him, really adds to the emotion.', '2008-09-25 18:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975460, 723429, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love his expression! Awesome shot.</td>', 'Love his expression! Awesome shot.', '2008-09-25 18:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975461, 724099, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good composition/crop.</td>', 'Good composition/crop.', '2008-09-25 18:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975462, 723913, 94265, '<td valign="top">This one is fantastic, hahaha. Really says <b>Bummer!</b> to me. Good job.</td>', 'This one is fantastic, hahaha. Really says Bummer! to me. Good job.', '2008-09-25 18:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975464, 724344, 94265, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scenery and colours.</td>', 'Gorgeous scenery and colours.', '2008-09-25 18:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975465, 724123, 94265, '<td valign="top">The look on the little guys'' face is really cute and funny :) Good shot.</td>', 'The look on the little guys'' face is really cute and funny :) Good shot.', '2008-09-25 18:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975468, 724435, 94265, '<td valign="top">That''s one scary looking spider! Great detail here, the stripey background is a wee bit distracting.</td>', 'That''s one scary looking spider! Great detail here, the stripey background is a wee bit distracting.', '2008-09-25 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975469, 723077, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is just brilliant, you can see the little one''s look of pure longing without even seeing his face. The b&amp;w looks great.</td>', 'This is just brilliant, you can see the little one''s look of pure longing without even seeing his face. The b&w looks great.', '2008-09-25 18:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975470, 724373, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love those dolls and the classic look of this shot.</td>', 'I love those dolls and the classic look of this shot.', '2008-09-25 18:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975472, 724305, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t entirely get this, or the look on his face but it''s very clear and the lighting is good.</td>', 'I don''t entirely get this, or the look on his face but it''s very clear and the lighting is good.', '2008-09-25 18:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975473, 723002, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand why the name Liberdade in a tattoo is a bummer, is it just meant to be waking up with a weird tattoo that''s the bummer? Either way, it''s a great, sharp shot and his expression is great. Like the crop also.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand why the name Liberdade in a tattoo is a bummer, is it just meant to be waking up with a weird tattoo that''s the bummer? Either way, it''s a great, sharp shot and his expression is great. Like the crop also.', '2008-09-25 18:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975474, 724408, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great capture of motion, the figure is very dark but it''s sunset so I realise you couldn''t really help that.</td>', 'Great capture of motion, the figure is very dark but it''s sunset so I realise you couldn''t really help that.', '2008-09-25 18:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975476, 723952, 94265, '<td valign="top">What''s the bummer here....? Great shot, I love these animals. Very beautiful and sharp, nice crop too.</td>', 'What''s the bummer here....? Great shot, I love these animals. Very beautiful and sharp, nice crop too.', '2008-09-25 18:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975477, 724280, 94265, '<td valign="top">Haha, it may be a bit of a stretch without the title but this is so damn cute, you can get away with it. Nice focus on his wee face.</td>', 'Haha, it may be a bit of a stretch without the title but this is so damn cute, you can get away with it. Nice focus on his wee face.', '2008-09-25 18:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975479, 724427, 94265, '<td valign="top">That light on the wall from the window is a wee bit harsh but it''s a nice set-up and very funny concept, she''s a sweet wee model too.</td>', 'That light on the wall from the window is a wee bit harsh but it''s a nice set-up and very funny concept, she''s a sweet wee model too.', '2008-09-25 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975480, 724184, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and detail.</td>', 'Great sharpness and detail.', '2008-09-25 18:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975481, 724483, 94265, '<td valign="top">Poor pony! I really like this, only thing is I don''t think the wee boy should be smiling and it''s cropped a bit tight at the bottom. Otherwise, good work!</td>', 'Poor pony! I really like this, only thing is I don''t think the wee boy should be smiling and it''s cropped a bit tight at the bottom. Otherwise, good work!', '2008-09-25 18:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975482, 723706, 94265, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture of the water, really well focused.</td>', 'Awesome capture of the water, really well focused.', '2008-09-25 18:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975483, 724363, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great motion shot and pretty funny too.</td>', 'Great motion shot and pretty funny too.', '2008-09-25 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975486, 724499, 94265, '<td valign="top">That is one displeased looking dog. Nice crop and soft colours.</td>', 'That is one displeased looking dog. Nice crop and soft colours.', '2008-09-25 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975488, 723707, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better without the reflection but it''s nice and sharp, like the colours and the DOF too.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better without the reflection but it''s nice and sharp, like the colours and the DOF too.', '2008-09-25 18:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975490, 723556, 80904, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. I hope this one ribbons 10</td>', 'Love this shot. I hope this one ribbons 10', '2008-09-25 18:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975491, 722754, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the look of this, from the open stationary box to the calligraphic writing and the sepia-ish tone; only one thing I''d change is the crop on bottom, I''d have lowered it just a weeeee bit.</td>', 'I love the look of this, from the open stationary box to the calligraphic writing and the sepia-ish tone; only one thing I''d change is the crop on bottom, I''d have lowered it just a weeeee bit.', '2008-09-25 18:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975492, 724072, 94265, '<td valign="top">Really great focus on the ice cream. Can''t for the life of me make out what flavour it is!</td>', 'Really great focus on the ice cream. Can''t for the life of me make out what flavour it is!', '2008-09-25 18:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975494, 724296, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the angle on this, the look of anticipation on her face is great though.</td>', 'Not sure about the angle on this, the look of anticipation on her face is great though.', '2008-09-25 18:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975495, 723867, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like this, the light is just a wee bit too bright on his shirt and cheek.</td>', 'I like this, the light is just a wee bit too bright on his shirt and cheek.', '2008-09-25 18:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975496, 724207, 94265, '<td valign="top">The focus on her seems a little off but this is a good idea and pretty amusing :) Her pose really says it all.</td>', 'The focus on her seems a little off but this is a good idea and pretty amusing :) Her pose really says it all.', '2008-09-25 18:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975500, 724424, 94265, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more contrast I think, otherwise good job, I like the crop and the idea itself.</td>', 'Needs a little more contrast I think, otherwise good job, I like the crop and the idea itself.', '2008-09-25 18:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975503, 724101, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I''d have zoomed back just a little so the crop doesn''t look quite so tight.</td>', 'Good idea, I''d have zoomed back just a little so the crop doesn''t look quite so tight.', '2008-09-25 18:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975510, 724479, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the little sliver of blue in the border to match the box, sort of breaks up all that white a bit.</td>', 'I like the little sliver of blue in the border to match the box, sort of breaks up all that white a bit.', '2008-09-25 18:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975511, 724112, 94265, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, the composition and costume are good.</td>', 'Cute kid, the composition and costume are good.', '2008-09-25 18:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975513, 724116, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not too sure about the composition here, there''s maybe a bit much in the shot but I absolutely love the fly-in-the-tea idea. Good lighting and focus too.</td>', 'I''m not too sure about the composition here, there''s maybe a bit much in the shot but I absolutely love the fly-in-the-tea idea. Good lighting and focus too.', '2008-09-25 18:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975514, 724224, 80904, '<td valign="top">might want someone from the SC to spell thief correctly for you.</td>', 'might want someone from the SC to spell thief correctly for you.', '2008-09-25 18:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975515, 724498, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the focus is off just a wee bit on him though.</td>', 'Great idea, the focus is off just a wee bit on him though.', '2008-09-25 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975519, 724159, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good focus and composition. The idea itself is quite good, though I''d have found it more appealing if the cat and clothes were wet, like if you placed her in there right after a bath, so it seemed like she''d accidentally went round in the wash.</td>', 'Good focus and composition. The idea itself is quite good, though I''d have found it more appealing if the cat and clothes were wet, like if you placed her in there right after a bath, so it seemed like she''d accidentally went round in the wash.', '2008-09-25 18:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975521, 723450, 94265, '<td valign="top">Little bit small but a cool idea, love the polka dot paper.</td>', 'Little bit small but a cool idea, love the polka dot paper.', '2008-09-25 18:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975524, 723915, 94265, '<td valign="top">Contrast looks a wee bit high, otherwise, great shot. Love the blue/grey tone.</td>', 'Contrast looks a wee bit high, otherwise, great shot. Love the blue/grey tone.', '2008-09-25 18:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975525, 724215, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and DOF.</td>', 'Nice focus and DOF.', '2008-09-25 18:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975526, 724283, 94265, '<td valign="top">Kudos on actually doing this (or getting someone to do it for you)! Very funny.</td>', 'Kudos on actually doing this (or getting someone to do it for you)! Very funny.', '2008-09-25 18:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975528, 724224, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think the idea is great and I like the composition but she looks like she''s stifling a laugh, which kinda takes away from the joke a bit.</td>', 'I think the idea is great and I like the composition but she looks like she''s stifling a laugh, which kinda takes away from the joke a bit.', '2008-09-25 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975529, 724135, 94265, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot and I like the close crop around the face but I don''t think there''s a <b>bummer!</b> connection here.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot and I like the close crop around the face but I don''t think there''s a bummer! connection here.', '2008-09-25 18:59:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4975530, 724041, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think this could use a wee bit of sharpening but the colours are great, I find his pose quite comical too.</td>', 'I think this could use a wee bit of sharpening but the colours are great, I find his pose quite comical too.', '2008-09-25 19:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975531, 724033, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good idea and focus but I''m not keen on the angle, I feel like that big bit of whatever it is in the foreground is in my way, I almost just wanna push it aside so I can see better, if that makes sense.</td>', 'Good idea and focus but I''m not keen on the angle, I feel like that big bit of whatever it is in the foreground is in my way, I almost just wanna push it aside so I can see better, if that makes sense.', '2008-09-25 19:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975532, 724460, 94265, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit harsh, great idea though. Never seen that version of the game before!</td>', 'Light is a bit harsh, great idea though. Never seen that version of the game before!', '2008-09-25 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975535, 723874, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is pretty funny, the white-shirted guy really looks confused as to why the car is empty, so the title works. Great focus and sharpness, I''d have cropped it up a bit just slightly.</td>', 'This is pretty funny, the white-shirted guy really looks confused as to why the car is empty, so the title works. Great focus and sharpness, I''d have cropped it up a bit just slightly.', '2008-09-25 19:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975538, 723955, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; I''d have liked to have seen an ice-cream van driving off or something to go with this scene.</td>', 'Nice shot; I''d have liked to have seen an ice-cream van driving off or something to go with this scene.', '2008-09-25 19:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975539, 723206, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the shot, his expression is great; the light is just a bit too bright in that confined space.</td>', 'I like the idea and the shot, his expression is great; the light is just a bit too bright in that confined space.', '2008-09-25 19:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975543, 724485, 94265, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of a lack of focus here and that glare on top of his head is distracting. I like the Dear John idea a lot though, it seems more poignant in this one since his wedding ring is prominent.</td>', 'There''s a bit of a lack of focus here and that glare on top of his head is distracting. I like the Dear John idea a lot though, it seems more poignant in this one since his wedding ring is prominent.', '2008-09-25 19:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975547, 724077, 94265, '<td valign="top">There''s something really cool about this shot, almost like it''s a still from a movie. Just a wee bit dark though.</td>', 'There''s something really cool about this shot, almost like it''s a still from a movie. Just a wee bit dark though.', '2008-09-25 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975548, 723762, 94265, '<td valign="top">Wee bit too much OOF.</td>', 'Wee bit too much OOF.', '2008-09-25 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975549, 723408, 94265, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective and the sun glare on the lens is minimal, well done there.</td>', 'Cool perspective and the sun glare on the lens is minimal, well done there.', '2008-09-25 19:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975551, 722484, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good shot, lot of shadows though, think maybe the shot being in colour would help me to pick out all the details better.</td>', 'Good shot, lot of shadows though, think maybe the shot being in colour would help me to pick out all the details better.', '2008-09-25 19:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4975553, 723787, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d like this so much more with a photo of a wedding dress and not just a quick doodle; I really like the idea and the vivid red background against the white but I''d have scored this higher if you''d stuck on a printed out picture of a dress.</td>', 'I''d like this so much more with a photo of a wedding dress and not just a quick doodle; I really like the idea and the vivid red background against the white but I''d have scored this higher if you''d stuck on a printed out picture of a dress.', '2008-09-25 19:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
