(4976479, 724159, 67763, '<td valign="top">A caution note for everyone using a dryer. This one brings back memories of 1967 when I was 20 years old.  A cat jumped into the dryer because it was warm and Mom threw a load of jeans in, closed the door and turned it on.  To this day I still look in the dryer before putting clothes in to be dried.  Bad memories.  Now that the cat has been in the dryer, make sure you look before using it, EVERY TIME.  The cat ends up dead and the clothes ruined from all the blood and body fluids from it banging around and around in there.  Who would have thought a dryer could be dangerous to your cat.</td>', 'A caution note for everyone using a dryer. This one brings back memories of 1967 when I was 20 years old.  A cat jumped into the dryer because it was warm and Mom threw a load of jeans in, closed the door and turned it on.  To this day I still look in the dryer before putting clothes in to be dried.  Bad memories.  Now that the cat has been in the dryer, make sure you look before using it, EVERY TIME.  The cat ends up dead and the clothes ruined from all the blood and body fluids from it banging around and around in there.  Who would have thought a dryer could be dangerous to your cat.', '2008-09-26 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
