(4980044, 723952, 66635, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this picture fits the challenge, but it sure is awesome!  The picture is an easy 10.  The fit for the challenge looks more like a 1.  You''ve put me in a tricky spot here.  But damn it''s a great picture!  I could REALLY STRETCH and say this fits "bummer" because you''ve photographed a hunter''s classic aiming point - perfect shot to the vitals.  That would be a bummer for the elk.  I hate giving a ten to a shot that is a DNMC, but I have to in this case.</td>', 'I don''t see how this picture fits the challenge, but it sure is awesome!  The picture is an easy 10.  The fit for the challenge looks more like a 1.  You''ve put me in a tricky spot here.  But damn it''s a great picture!  I could REALLY STRETCH and say this fits "bummer" because you''ve photographed a hunter''s classic aiming point - perfect shot to the vitals.  That would be a bummer for the elk.  I hate giving a ten to a shot that is a DNMC, but I have to in this case.', '2008-09-29 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
