(4984793, 723074, 52115, '<td valign="top">The fear of every clown, and most others, too. It''s very good representation of that concept. It doesn''t look bad with the character in the Botom-Right 1/4-ers, but the space on the bottom <b>emphasises more emptyness</b>, as does the static-ness of being centered.</td>', 'The fear of every clown, and most others, too. It''s very good representation of that concept. It doesn''t look bad with the character in the Botom-Right 1/4-ers, but the space on the bottom emphasises more emptyness, as does the static-ness of being centered.', '2008-10-01 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4984836, 723573, 52115, '<td valign="top">So did you point your camera and shoot this P&amp;S?<br/>We all point and shoot, it''s what goes on in our heads and all the preparation before and processing after that counts.</td>', 'So did you point your camera and shoot this P&S?We all point and shoot, it''s what goes on in our heads and all the preparation before and processing after that counts.', '2008-10-01 14:02:47.000000', NULL, 0),
