(4985039, 722556, 61818, '<td valign="top">I typed up and deleted a comment on this shot during voting a dozen times.  I guess I''m more of a prude than I thought, or maybe it''s because I don''t have kids but it really made me uncomfortable to look at it.  Totally on my end, no inference of anything malicious on yours, but naked little kid butt posted on the net just doesn''t feel right to me.  Reading through your comments it looks like I am alone in getting creeped out over it.</td>', 'I typed up and deleted a comment on this shot during voting a dozen times.  I guess I''m more of a prude than I thought, or maybe it''s because I don''t have kids but it really made me uncomfortable to look at it.  Totally on my end, no inference of anything malicious on yours, but naked little kid butt posted on the net just doesn''t feel right to me.  Reading through your comments it looks like I am alone in getting creeped out over it.', '2008-10-01 15:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4985086, 724373, 38032, '<td valign="top">Inspirational, funny, and cool.  what more could you ask for?  a ribbon would have been nice I suppose but it might have its rightful seat as a gem in the sands of mediocrity.</td>', 'Inspirational, funny, and cool.  what more could you ask for?  a ribbon would have been nice I suppose but it might have its rightful seat as a gem in the sands of mediocrity.', '2008-10-01 15:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
