(4990935, 724443, 77196, '<td valign="top">This autism awareness ribbon is a magnet on the back of our van - original photo is: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=724987" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/724987.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/724987.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/77196/120/724987.jpg"/></a>. In PP, adjusting levels to try to minimize the background (the van and its shadows &amp; uneven surfaces - not to mention dust) basically reduced it to all black and made the colors really stand out. I take the comments that it looks like it was created in photoshop &amp; not a picture as a compliment. But, seriously folks (and you know who you are) - my kids with autism are more flexible than some of you were on this one...<br/></td>', 'This autism awareness ribbon is a magnet on the back of our van - original photo is: . In PP, adjusting levels to try to minimize the background (the van and its shadows & uneven surfaces - not to mention dust) basically reduced it to all black and made the colors really stand out. I take the comments that it looks like it was created in photoshop & not a picture as a compliment. But, seriously folks (and you know who you are) - my kids with autism are more flexible than some of you were on this one...', '2008-10-04 02:47:04.000000', NULL, 0),
