(5150157, 722556, 101917, '<td valign="top">We have just published an article, Child Model or Porn Star, the article voices concern at the number of preteen websites that try to pass themselves off as agents for child models.  Many of the children depicted are aged three to thirteen and the dress, pose and sophisticated look of the model are inappropriate and could only be classed as pornographic. it appears that as long as the child is not nude it is legal.  We do state in the article that there is nothing wrong with a photograph of a child that is appropriate and this image is one that is both appropriate and funny.<br/> <br/>We should not be ashamed of appreciating the beauty of the naked form, child or adult, as long as it is appropriate and not intended pander to basic carnal desires of the depraved, which many of these sites are.<br/> <br/>Loved the picture from a none photographer -- thanks to the digital camera I take several hundred shots knowing one will be very good.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.my-kent.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.my-kent.com</a></td>', 'We have just published an article, Child Model or Porn Star, the article voices concern at the number of preteen websites that try to pass themselves off as agents for child models.  Many of the children depicted are aged three to thirteen and the dress, pose and sophisticated look of the model are inappropriate and could only be classed as pornographic. it appears that as long as the child is not nude it is legal.  We do state in the article that there is nothing wrong with a photograph of a child that is appropriate and this image is one that is both appropriate and funny. We should not be ashamed of appreciating the beauty of the naked form, child or adult, as long as it is appropriate and not intended pander to basic carnal desires of the depraved, which many of these sites are. Loved the picture from a none photographer -- thanks to the digital camera I take several hundred shots knowi